  "prefLabel": "He-C 6340.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6340.02 Scope. This part shall apply to individuals or agencies that seek certification to receive financial reimbursement from the department of health and human services (DHHS) for the provision of adoptive report writing services.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6340) #9264, eff 9-20-08; ss by #12059, eff 12-6-16",
